{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t政府公布，截至9月底，本財政年度首6個月財政盈餘162億元，主要由於發行銀色債券所得收入。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n政府上半年度開支3731億元，收入2718億元。期內發行政府債券所得1310億元，償還政府債券135億元本金。截至9月底，財政儲備6817億元。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:55.278696+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:00:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:23.840312+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:31.578076+00:00","content_hash":"da4645903b127f9a470f60a5a380e51322c9d5dba2c07ebfaf67a43852264a94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}